+// Crux2 - the console's picture tools on PCSX2's Vulkan device: AMD FSR 3's optical flow for frame
+// generation and NVIDIA Image Scaling (ps5/frontend/ps5_compute_fx.h, compute shaders), and the
+// look: a libretro preset run as a chain of passes (ps5/frontend/ps5_slang.h and
+// ps5_slang_runner.h). Each is made the first time it is asked for, and stays off (said once in
+// the boot log) when the driver cannot make it. needs proper testing on a console
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0+
+
